<h3>Note:</h3>

<ul>
<li>This sample script can be used for your sample Spreadsheet. If the format of the values are changed, the script might not be able to be used. Please be careful this.</li>
</ul>

<h3>References:</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/Reduce" rel="nofollow noreferrer">reduce()</a></li>
